            "text_PPCEJb": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Skincare isn’t about fixing yourself. It’s about caring for yourself.<br/><br/>At Oladerm, we believe healthy skin begins with something deeper than products — it begins with self-respect. With choosing yourself, even on busy days. With showing up for your skin the way you show up for the people you love.<br/><br/>Because when you care for your skin consistently and gently, you’re not chasing perfection. You’re practicing self-love.And that changes everything.</p>",
